Mental Disorder</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bolton</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>Mind, Meaning and Mental Disorder</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>300</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bracken</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><source>Postpsychiatry</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bracken</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><source>Postpsychiatry</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>5</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bracken</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><source>Postpsychiatry</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>11</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bracken</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><source>Postpsychiatry</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>Oxford: Oxford University Press</publisher-name></citation></